        "text_kdfjAT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Delivered directly to their inbox or printable for a personal touch, it's perfect for anyone ready to explore with sharp, crystal-clear vision. </h4><h4>Tick the I want to send as a git box: Add recipients email, name and you can write an optional message. Let us know when you would like us to send it or leave it blank for it to be issued within 12 hours.</h4><h4>The recipient can shop online or contact us directly for personalized assistance to find the ideal mask, lenses, and gear for their ultimate aquatic adventure. We are more than happy to help them with the process of ensuring the mask is the best fit, the lenses are a perfect match for underwater clarity and comfort, and also that they have a pleasant experience throughout. Rest assured knowing that we will look after them. </h4><h4>Help someone dive into legendary moments with the gift of vision and finally being able to say \"I'm in the I can sea club\"</h4>"
          }
        }
